Guard runtime002 REFUSED{short('consumer-guard-test-runtime002/INDEPENDENT_GUARD_RUNTIME_STATIC_REVIEW_002.json')}: nine missing late string checks and peer12/profile7 mismatch;112files/62pairs preserved/all14UNRUN. Distinct003 typed correction authoring, unbound/unrun. Raw004169P2expectedS remains isolated/spent, not current-policy/fullgate/release/native proof. Native002/grammar004 source-only; cap/typedbehavior/argv/pins pending. ROOT016 docs qualifiedPASS with separate timestamp supplement; frozen bytes retained. SoleACK/nativequiet/Pro3 lease unresolved; ROOTcanonical workheld, request011 no delivery claim. Preserve science/twins/epoch/attempts/reserves/pipedGO/noNonInteractive/no-public/no-replay; monitor restore at closeout. Earlier bytes below exact history.

'''.encode('utf-8')
handoff = body.replace('# Major step017 - new live release observed; staged admission policy needs a fresh chain',
                       '# Current pro2 handoff - major step017')
handoff = re.sub(r'\]\(([^)]+)\)', lambda m: '](' + m.group(1) + ')' if m.group(1).startswith(('http', '../', 'D:'))
                 else '](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/' + m.group(1) + ')', handoff)
start = '''# Start here

Read [HANDOFF](HANDOFF.md), [checkpoint017](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_017.md) and newest [SESSION](resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md).

